{"text": "Old Behrman was a painter who lived on the ground floor below them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was past sixty and had a long gray beard. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For forty years he had painted, but he had never been successful. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was always about to paint a masterpiece, but he had never yet begun it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He drank too much and laughed at softness in anyone. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Yet he thought of himself as a guard to protect the two young artists upstairs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When Sue told him about Johnsys idea, he shouted angrily at such foolishness. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That night a cold rain fell, mixed with snow, and a fierce wind blew all night long. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sue was sure that the last leaf would be gone by morning.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "l", "d", " ", "B", "e", "h", "r", "m", "a", "n", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "p", "a", "i", "n", "t", "e", "r", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", "d", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "g", "r", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "f", "l", "o", "o", "r", " ", "b", "e", "l", "o", "w", " ", "t", "h", "e", "m", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "p", "a", "s", "t", " ", "s", "i", "x", "t", "y", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "a", " ", "l", "o", "n", "g", " ", "g", "r", "a", "y", " ", "b", "e", "a", "r", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "F", "o", "r", " ", "f", "o", "r", "t", "y", " ", "y", "e", "a", "r", "s", " ", "h", "e", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "p", "a", "i", "n", "t", "e", "d", ",", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "h", "e", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "n", "e", "v", "e", "r", " ", "b", "e", "e", "n", " ", "s", "u", "c", "c", "e", "s", "s", "f", "u", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", 